    "body": "**Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**\r\nGNL are changing how the cookie banner works in the EU/EEA - but not in the UK.\r\n\r\n**Describe the solution you'd like**\r\nCreate a component that meets the requirements of GNL:\r\n* The banner is an overlay for the entire page.  It is not possible for the user to interact with the page without accepting the cookies\r\n* The banner will display the new wording (set in service config in Simorgh)\r\n* Clicking the agree button will set the ckns_explicit cookie = `2` and the ckns_policy cookie = `111`\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1295\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2019-09-02 at 10 11 17\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/8124899/64103514-5488f500-cd6a-11e9-91ba-4286e367373e.png\">\r\n\r\n**Describe alternatives you've considered**\r\nN/A\r\n\r\n**Testing notes**\r\n[Tester to complete]\r\n\r\nDev insight: Will Cypress tests be required or are unit tests sufficient? Will there be any potential regression? etc\r\n\r\n- [ ] This feature is expected to need manual testing.\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nAdd any other context or screenshots about the feature request here.\r\n",
